WEBVTT

NOTE
The Ragnarok in flight — cockpit and a large structure.
Duration: approximately 26 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
A glowing energy sphere flares around the Ragnarok.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.680
Inside its twin-seat cockpit, the stars wheel beyond the canopy.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.680
The red ship sweeps low past a huge blue-grey structure.
